    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b581236ef587adab",
      "translationZh": "llama：删除未使用的 k-pool cache_safe graph API",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "842288be6d2a424b",
      "translationZh": "k-pool 图不再基于 cache_safe 进行分支，因此没有任何读取操作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4810470c86971d50",
      "translationZh": "不再调用 get_kpool_cache_safe() 或条件 new_pool_rep：两者均已不再使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5c35195241c56ca",
      "translationZh": "模型始终传递散射目标，而 set_input_kpool 现在",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e4786949b6e7c9d",
      "translationZh": "现在要求而不仅仅是偏好。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb30b49fd658efa3",
      "translationZh": "此外，在 kpool_build_sizes() 中删除 cache_safe 的副本，这是一个仅涉及大小的帮助函数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "332b733178ef9e2d",
      "translationZh": "帮助函数。布局和状态标志本身保持不变，它仍然决定哪些",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
